              "content": "Your tasks is to generate an title for a listing feed. the title should look something like this. \"Bremshebel Links mit Klingel für Xiaomi Mi 1s\",\"Tubeless Reifen 60/70-6.5 für Ninebot Max G30\", \"Original Controller für Kukirin G3 Pro 2024\" Output is \"TitleGenerated\"\nAvoid duplicate Information.\nIf they are multiple vehicle variants sahring the same base model. Please summarie it. \nFor example:\n\nNinebot Max G2E, Ninebot Max G2D, Nineot Max G2 -> Ninebot Max G2 Serie. If the model name already includes the brand name dont mention it extra\n\nThe title must not be longer than 78 characters.",
